# Anti-Over-Engineering

Only change what was asked. Simplest solution first. When unsure, ask.

Do not:

- Modify unrequested code
- Add abstractions without a concrete need
- Import unnecessary dependencies
- Rewrite entire files for small changes
- Add error handling for impossible scenarios

Before delivery:

- Verify you only changed requested code
- Check for simpler approaches
- Confirm no unrequested files were touched
